 ### [GNeuVox](11357-gneuvox.md)
-GNeuVox is a differentiable volume rendering framework for fast human radiance field optimization that replaces implicit MLPs with explicit neural voxel grids to accelerate training from hours to minutes. It distinguishes itself by maintaining two separate voxel grids: general voxels ($V_g$) pretrained across multiple subjects to provide geometric priors, and individual voxels ($V_i$) optimized per subject to capture unique differential textures. This separation allows the model to converge rapidly during fine-tuning while maintaining rendering quality comparable to methods requiring significantly longer training times. It is chosen for fast human avatar training. [GNeuVox](11357-gneuvox.md)
